{"prompt": "BAD EXAMPLE - never do this: conn.executescript(sql_script)", "response": "# WRONG - DuckDB does not support executescript()\n# CORRECT - execute each statement individually:\nfor sql in sql_statements:\n    conn.execute(sql.strip())"}